  "body": "Enjoy an exceptional coastal lifestyle in this spacious boutique beachfront apartment complex known as 'the Rocks' situated in the pre eminent location of Takapuna Beach. The key elements of Location, Lifestyle, Convenience and Security are captured here combined with one level, easy living.  \r\n\r\nOne of only 13 tightly held exclusive residences, this elegant, sun filled apartment with 2.7m stud, offers three double bedrooms, the master with ensuite and spa bath and generous walk in wardrobe, a wide entrance hallway leads to the super spacious open plan kitchen/dining/lounge, three secure basement carparks with a large storage room, a well equipped gym and sauna, heated swimming pool and picturesque sea views of the Gulf and Rangitoto, contained on a near acre site of well maintained landscaped gardens, extensive lawns, hard standing and ample visitor car parking, direct access to the beach and Hurstmere Road.  The Rocks is also pet friendly. \r\n\r\nWhether your passion is walking your dog on the beach, swimming, sailing or boating, paddleboarding or simply relaxing by the water, with Takapuna Beach Cafe conveniently just across the road and Takapuna shops, restaurants, theatre, movies and Sunday market near at hand, this sought after lock up and leave residence has it all at your doorstep.  \r\n\r\nAn ideal place for a wide range of buyers of all ages looking for high quality living in a secure and first rate environment at one of Takapuna's most desirable beachfront addresses.  \r\n\r\nTo take advantage of this rare opportunity, call Alison Parker, Takapuna Apartment Specialist at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty to arrange a personal viewing on 021983533.  \r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale closes 25 November 2026 if not sold prior.",
